]>I ask because my God is angry at me.  The only possible bad things I
]>have done is to kill a friendly giant and to pray once too soon.
	Praying too soon will do it - they don't like you being greedy.
	The normal interval is random (much more than it used to be?),
	but the minimum is around 300, linger if they've done things
	for you or you've annoyed them.
	Go sacrifice things until they appear satisfied.
	If you do mildly bad things, like killing friendly monsters,
	they'll calm down after a while.
	Be careful not to kill unicorns of your alignment, and (it
	should be needless to say) they say human sacrifice is a
	very chaotic thing to do.
	Sacrificing on other gods' altars might re-align the altar,
	if you're lucky.

